Ugly Newt provided a gameplay reason. There's an in-game reason (at
least for priests) as well: gnome and dwarf monsters don't have priests
at all, while orcs have shamans instead. Presumably, they don't pray to
deities, but to nature in general (and your PC, if he's an orc praying
to Set, is a heretic). Note that gnomes do get wizards, and you can play
a gnomish wizard, too.

